<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 15.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 15.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali receives U.S. Under-Secretary for defense Walter Slocombe. The U.S. praised Tunisia's contribution to the Middle East peace process.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- First Lady Leila Ben Ali chaired the opening of the Diplomatic Bazar.</p>
